<mxCell id="b4n" value="1 2 3 4 = fixed positions. Each is a TAB (opens a body) or a BUTTON (acts). Here: 1,2 = tabs; 3 = ⚙ pane settings tab; 4 = orientation BUTTON. Active tab is solid and joins its body." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#8896a0;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Menlo" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="134" width="290" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
